    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18295" root="زهد" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَهْدٌ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>A small quantity.</i> (A.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُذْ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَهْدَ مَا يَكْفِيكَ</span> (JK, S, K) (tropical:)  <i>Take thou the small
quantity that is sufficient for thee:</i> (A:) or <i>as
much as is sufficient for thee.</i> (JK, S.)

